  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/257) by Paolo Stivanin (Bitbucket: [Paolo](https://bitbucket.org/Paolo), GitHub: [Paolo](https://github.com/Paolo)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello,\n\nthe wiki needs a small update about ART’s availability on openSUSE :grinning:\n\n* for Tumbleweed, the user can now simply install ART from the official repo \\(`sudo zypper in ART`\\)\n* for Leap 15.3 and 15.4, the user must install ART using `opi` \\(`sudo zypper in opi` and then `sudo opi ART` and select the one from `graphics`\\)\n\nThanks a lot!\n",
